-- 登记: A09 | 语义: 再写同一句 ORI。apply 已经是同值，restore 同样不改几何 | expected_net: unchanged | restore 搭档: 本文件是 xform/ori_same_apply.mac 的 restore
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-XFORM-ORI-SAME-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-EQ-PA
Q REF
Q NAME
Q ORI
ORI Y IS N AND Z IS U
Q ORI
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite xform/ori_same restore: EQ-PA ORI rewritten unchanged'
$P SUITE-XFORM-ORI-SAME-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
